o has  the net terminal gene because it's only  when he discovers someone with this gene  that the civilization would finally be  able to regain control over the enhanced  artificial intelligence and shut down  the menacing safeguard defense system  this obviously surprises everyone but  their leader then remembers that he  heard about the net terminal gene a long  time ago he also refers to a place  inside their parameter which they aren't  supposed to go to or so their ancestors  have always told them it's the rotting  shrine and once kelly hears about this  he immediately gets up and starts  approaching the shrine the leader zuru  and her friend accompany him  there they witness an unstable hologram  apparently it's projecting out of a  corpse-like robot of a woman named sibo  she talks and says that she's been  waiting for 17 million  526 000 hours as for her intro she's a  scientist from a time before this  infection happened and civilization was  driven into a corner keeley wonders if  she has the net terminal jeans but she  says of course not however she reveals  some interesting pieces of information  it's because of a shield she created  that this place has forever remained  free of the safeguard defense system not  only that if keeley can take her 15  blocks away to an automated factory she  can get them rations and also create a  synthetic terminal that'll have the same  effect as that of the net terminal gene  the journey to that automated factory  would have taken them more than a couple  of days  and since if the experiment succeeded  the village would have benefited greatly  the leader assembles a group of  experienced folks to accompany killi  zuru and thai are amongst the group  members and so the journey begins they  stop they eat except keely he doesn't  need to eat food after a couple of days  worth of hustle of hiding from the  safeguard the guys finally reached the  desired automated factory once there  sibo helps operate the system she logs  in and instantly locates a substantial  supply of rations for the village the  folks now have food that will probably  last a while but the plan doesn't go as  smoothly as it could have sibo makes a  gadget for keely but right when she  tries to log out of the system something  triggers a reaction from the safeguard  suddenly an insane number of  exterminators pop up they're here to  exterminate the intruders she quickly  uses the system and creates a cyborg  form from her body and then with the  help of a railway car everyone gets back  to the village there was a big  confrontation with the exterminators  many lose their lives while keeley went  above and beyond in trying to save as  many as he could dare lost her arm and  after all the fighting keeley was  knocked unconscious  now that they're back at the village  keeley is given a proper space to rest  he still hasn't regained his  consciousness meanwhile the entire  village celebrates the incredible amount  of food rations that they've secured  though it was also a moment of grief and  silence considering how many of them  lost their lives during this pursuit and  all the ones before it so in order to  mourn the loss the village leaders  ordered to turn off the lights and let  everyone have a moment of silence for  all those who have lost their lives  until now  kili is lying in his chamber zuru pays  him a visit and starts wondering about  what keeley will be doing from here on  out siba also enters the room she makes  him come back to his consciousness and  then takes him down to the shield  generator though at that point something  unexpected happened zuru's dear friend  daai gets to the observatory and then  using her gun she shoots the shield  generator this in turn alerts the  safeguard system though why would she do  such a thing to all of her people well  as it turns out the real thai had died  during the confrontation with the  exterminators the one who accompanied  them back was a fake one sent by the  