fore they can get there a watchtower  lays its eye on them yet again it  instantly sends a humongous exterminator  kili gives the exterminator stealth  gadget to zuru tells them that he'll  keep trying to find the net terminal  gene and then silently bids them  farewell  while they get to the abandoned level he  engages in combat with the exterminator  to put it simply he seemingly sacrifices  himself to save them in the epilogue of  the film there's a young girl  reminiscing about this story she talks  as the visuals show a village prospering  within that abandoned level she is  zuru's granddaughter and obviously she  always shared keeley's stories with her  granddaughter and now as her  granddaughter holds the gadget she  wonders or rather she believes the  keeley is still out there searching for  the net terminal gene  then we see keeley walking and searching  as always  at that point  the movie ends right there and then the  film appears to be a side quest when  compared with the manga but it is still  enjoyable it can serve as a nice  introduction to anyone who wants to  experience this series now what did you  think of the story did you like it are  you planning on watching it or have you  watched it already share your thoughts  in the comments section down below i'm  always looking forward to hearing them  well then i'll see you in the next video
 

